    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_11",
      "hash64": "56D5219ADF03E1EA",
      "text": "¿Se-seréis capaz de perdonarme algún día?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_12",
      "hash64": "56D5209ADF03E037",
      "text": "Os di mi palabra de que obtendría dos trajes de\\nninja para disfrazarnos juntos, mas...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_02",
      "hash64": "CFF664CFE1993D94",
      "text": "Ah, no os preocupéis. Ya los he comprado yo.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_13",
      "hash64": "56D51F9ADF03DE84",
      "text": "¿Cómo?...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_03",
      "hash64": "CFF665CFE1993F47",
      "text": "He pasado por la tienda cuando acababa de\\nllegarles la mercancía y he comprado dos: uno\\r\\npara vos y otro para un servidor.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_04",
      "hash64": "CFF662CFE1993A2E",
      "text": "Suponía que se agotarían en un abrir y cerrar de\\nojos, así que no he querido esperar.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_05",
      "hash64": "CFF663CFE1993BE1",
      "text": "¡Venga, vamos a cambiarnos y a jugar a los ninja!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_14",
      "hash64": "56D51E9ADF03DCD1",
      "text": "¡Qué buena nueva, amigo mío![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_15",
      "hash64": "56D51D9ADF03DB1E",
      "text": "En tal caso, permitidme una breve ausencia. He\\nde ir a mis aposentos para recoger mis shuriken\\r\\ny dotar a nuestro juego de mayor realismo.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_06",
      "hash64": "CFF660CFE19936C8",
      "text": "¡Genial!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_16",
      "hash64": "56D51C9ADF03D96B",
      "text": "Si gustáis, podría también ejercer mis dotes de\\ncosturero y arreglar los disfraces para que gocen\\r\\nde un aura tóxica y misteriosa...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_07",
      "hash64": "CFF661CFE199387B",
      "text": "Hm... Eso ya sería pasarse.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
